sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Farmer
    participant W as Web app (nginx)
    participant G as Gateway
    participant I as Identity service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (identity)
    U->>W: Enter email and password
    W->>G: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    G->>G: Origin check, rate limit (login is CSRF-exempt)
    G->>I: Forward request (X-Client-IP)
    I->>DB: Load user by email
    DB-->>I: User + Argon2id hash
    I->>I: Verify password, build RS256 access JWT (15 min)
    I->>DB: Store hashed refresh token (new family)
    I-->>G: 200 + Set-Cookie as_access, as_refresh, as_csrf
    G-->>W: Cookies forwarded
    W-->>U: Redirect to overview
